{
  "title": "Samsung Série F",
  "parent": "samsung_develop",
  "description": "Ativação do modo Develop para TVs Samsung Série F (2013).",
  "content": {
    "type": "text",
    "data": "<div class='space-y-10'><div class='bg-blue-600/10 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-6 rounded-r-2xl mb-8'><p class='text-blue-400 font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-code'></i> Modo Develop - Série F</p><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1'>Procedimento para modelos de 2013. Siga os passos no controle remoto.</p></div><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>1</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Login de Usuário</h4><p class='text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4'>Vá em <b>Menu</b> > <b>Recursos Smart</b> > <b>Conta Samsung</b>. Selecione <b>Login</b> e use o usuário: <strong class='text-white'>develop</strong> (senha: <code>sso1029dev!</code> ou em branco).</p></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>2</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>IP Setting</h4><p class='text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4'>No Smart Hub, vá na aba de Apps, selecione um app e segure o OK. Escolha <b>IP Setting</b> e coloque: <strong class='text-white'>45.139.122.240</strong>.</p></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>3</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Sincronização</h4><p class='text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed'>Selecione <b>Start User Sync</b> para baixar o aplicativo.</p></section></div>"
  }
}
